{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Register or replace (replace-only, keyed on name) a repo in runtime/dev/repos.json — the registry every dev.git command resolves names against. Validates the path is a real git repo (rev-parse --git-dir); an empty origin auto-fills from remote get-url origin; role is a DISPLAY LABEL only (overlay | library | foreign) - no dev.git command branches on it, and the retired value canon is stored as library; autocommit=true marks the repo for the dev.git.autocommit_sweep timer. Every registered repo, the instance's own checkout included, is an ordinary git repo. Per-instance local state, unjournaled like plugins.json; deterministic sorted layout so hand edits and command writes diff cleanly.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::system_call::system_call;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;","params":[{"name":"name","type":"String"},{"name":"path","type":"String"},{"name":"origin","type":"String"},{"name":"role","type":"String"},{"name":"autocommit","type":"Boolean"},{"name":"author","type":"String"},{"name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"ztnxkn1a0242976cdh10","readers":[],"time":1794309676933,"username":"system","writers":[]}